			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3865879">
									

<p>Wait a second&#8230; is this the Jewish conspiracy? Does that mean InfoWars is a Foundation front? Requesting <a href="https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/WordOfGod">Word of God</a> on the matter.</p>
<p>Addendum: I am not arguing that the Jewish conspiracy is real. In fact, I believe that there are entries <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-3999">on this site</a> that have more of a basis in objective reality than the Jewish conspiracy.</p>
<p>I just love fiction that re-contextualizes the real world and it's history. In fact, the only parts of Harry Potter I found paletteable (sc?) were the bits where they went back to important parts of London history and gave the story about what was *actually* happening. You know, Jack the Ripper was actually a Death Eater rampage intended to wipe out the mudbloods, the London Fires were actually a duel between professional rivals that got hilariously out of hand and resulted in the current government's rules for dueling, etc.</p>

